{
  "model": "IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "pause_seconds": 0.7,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "s13-p01",
      "text": "Bob likes climbing.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p02",
      "text": "But he was sad that there wasn't a climbing club in his school at first.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p03-01",
      "text": "At the beginning of the second year of middle school,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p03-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p03-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p03-02",
      "text": "his school offered rock climbing lessons in order to encourage students to exercise.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p03-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p03-02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p04",
      "text": "He joined at once.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p04.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p05",
      "text": "He had planned to wear a jacket, a pair of jeans and a T-shirt.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p05.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p06",
      "text": "But before the first class, he was notified to wear hiking boots and prepare warm clothing, such as a sweater.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p06.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p07",
      "text": "In class, the coach said, \"Rock climbing needs strength, speed, courage and persistence.\"",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p07.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p08",
      "text": "It interested him.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p08.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p09",
      "text": "The students were asked to run 1,000 metres first, and then climb with a rope.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p09.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p10",
      "text": "When Bob finished running, he almost lost his breath and got bored.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p10.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p11",
      "text": "He thought it was less interesting than before.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p11.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p12",
      "text": "The coach noticed that and asked him, \"Why do you want to take rock climbing lessons?\"",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p12.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p13",
      "text": "\"I come for fun, sir.\"",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p13.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p14",
      "text": "\"Is that fun?\" he asked.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p14.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p15",
      "text": "Bob shook his head slowly.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p15.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p16",
      "text": "The coach then explained patiently, \"That's because you stop halfway. You know, beautiful sights are always on the top.\"",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p16.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p17",
      "text": "After hearing his words, Bob made up his mind to finish his journey.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p17.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p18",
      "text": "When he got to the top in the end, he felt really excited.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p18.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p18.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p19",
      "text": "Although feeling sore in his muscles, he was determined to keep going.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p19.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p19.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p20-01",
      "text": "Sometimes it's hard to reach the top of the mountain, especially on windy days,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p20-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p20-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13-p20-02",
      "text": "but it's a pity to stop halfway, so don't give up.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p20-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s13-p20-02.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "word_audio": "browser speech synthesis en-GB"
}
